    "title": "Marshalls Official",
    "description": "OH, HELLO!\r\n\r\nThanks for downloading the Marshalls App. Now you can shop amazing styles & savings anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nThere\u2019s two super exciting ways to find surprises:\r\n\r\n-\tUse the Snap It, Shop It feature to search for items. Just take a picture of anything \r\n        you see (and love), and we\u2019ll show you similar styles.\r\n-\tCreate Your Custom Closet by selecting styles and details you love, and we\u2019ll create a \r\n        personal collection just for you. \r\n\r\nOther trips & tricks you need to know about:\r\n\r\n-\tUse our Store Locator to find a store near you.\r\n-\tUpload e-gift cards and Reward Certificates right to your account.\r\n-\tManage your TJX Rewards Credit Card account on the go. \r\n-\tRegister for the Marshalls App to create a mobile account (you can use your \r\n        HomeGoods and T.J.Maxx account here as well).",
    "descriptionHTML": "OH, HELLO!<br><br>Thanks for downloading the Marshalls App. Now you can shop amazing styles &amp; savings anytime, anywhere.<br><br>There\u2019s two super exciting ways to find surprises:<br><br>-\tUse the Snap It, Shop It feature to search for items. Just take a picture of anything <br>        you see (and love), and we\u2019ll show you similar styles.<br>-\tCreate Your Custom Closet by selecting styles and details you love, and we\u2019ll create a <br>        personal collection just for you. <br><br>Other trips &amp; tricks you need to know about:<br><br>-\tUse our Store Locator to find a store near you.<br>-\tUpload e-gift cards and Reward Certificates right to your account.<br>-\tManage your TJX Rewards Credit Card account on the go. <br>-\tRegister for the Marshalls App to create a mobile account (you can use your <br>        HomeGoods and T.J.Maxx account here as well).",
